OL,13,     FBarryscourt Castle, Co Cork, one
OL,14,     Fof Ireland's finest surviving
OL,15,     Fmedieval tower houses, newly
OL,16,     Freopened after extensive
OL,17,     Fconservation works.
OL,18,G0005 Cheaters
OL,19,     FJosh arrives back at his flat to
OL,20,     Fdiscover that Esther has just
OL,21,     Freturned from her travels with her
OL,22,     Fnew beau, Lars, in tow.
